OL,3,GNEWSASmart glasses bring 'considerable
OL,4,Aprivacy risks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders are being warned about the
OL,7,F"considerable privacy risks" in
OL,8,Frecording using smart glasses.
OL,10,FThe Isle of Man, Jersey and Guernsey's
OL,11,Fdata protection authorities have teamed
OL,12,Fup to warn that the discreet and
OL,13,Fwearable technology could capture
OL,14,Fconversations and personal information
OL,15,Fwithout people knowing.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
